        "quote": "(b) Any person who knowingly assembles with one or more persons and agrees with such person or persons to violate any of the criminal laws of the State of Kansas or of the United States with force or violence by reason of any motive or intent relating to, or any antipathy, animosity or hostility based upon, another individual’s or group of individuals’ membership in a protected class as defined in TMC 9.20.020 shall be guilty of a misdemeanor.",
