          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.20.040:block:12",
          "start": 1214
        },
        "quote": "(1) Upon a first conviction of a violation of the provisions of this section a person shall be deemed guilty of a Class B misdemeanor and shall be punished by a fine in an amount not to exceed $1,000, or by a sentence not to exceed six months, or by both such fine and imprisonment.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.20.040:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 9.20.040 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "dacbe1b0-2813-531b-891d-703134dbae1c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1818,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.20.040:block:13",
          "start": 1497
        },
        "quote": "(2) On a second or subsequent conviction of a violation of the provisions of this section a person shall be deemed guilty of a Class A misdemeanor and shall be punished by a fine in an amount not to exceed $2,500, or by a sentence not to exceed one year, or by both such fine and imprisonment. (Ord. 20276 § 4, 12-15-20.)",
